165 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 144 0 R
/E (This project analyzes a retail transaction dataset covering the period December 2010 to December 2011. The dataset contains invoice-level purchase records including InvoiceNo, InvoiceDate, CustomerID, Quantity, UnitPrice, and Country. A Revenue variable was calculated as Quantity multiplied by UnitPrice to measure order performance.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 144 0 R
/E (The objective of this project was to perform an end-to-end data analytics workflow, starting from data cleaning and preparation, moving through exploratory analysis and dashboard development, and finally validating business insights using statistical hypothesis testing.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
167 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 144 0 R
/E (The analysis aimed to identify seasonal revenue patterns, evaluate product performance, understand customer retention behavior through cohort analysis, and determine whether seasonal revenue growth was driven by higher order value or increased transaction volume.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
